  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAFRANCE/status/2042492487089209690",
      "reply_text": "Impressive all-around game from Yabu. His defense really stood out tonight.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:10:35.564517+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/JonnyRoot_/status/2042473427827900458",
      "reply_text": "That's harsh. He's still a rookie.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:11:20.129834+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ChrisSmoove/status/2042482111832068428",
      "reply_text": "Bronny's minutes are getting interesting",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:11:55.551172+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/VarysOnNBA/status/2042466564033900648",
      "reply_text": "Fair point. Those series weren't close",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:12:49.258313+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/nuggetsfan_/status/2042459573026521424",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's the schedule. Nice win for the Lakers though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:13:30.511907+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/FanaticsBook/status/2042457086768947318",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that assist would be a big deal. LeBron's legacy is still growing.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:14:08.711386+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/WadexFlash/status/2042459143412597044",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, it's not easy. Nobody has done it in a while",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:24:48.258987+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/hangszn/status/2042494121701753095",
      "reply_text": "That's a tough ask. The Heat have been on a roll lately.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:25:35.180183+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/xxxxx23340/status/2042497706111750523",
      "reply_text": "But the Magic still have to prove it. One game doesn't make a season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:26:19.628094+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Basket_Infos/status/2042472856806670525",
      "reply_text": "Warriors were missing Curry. That's a big gap in their offense.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:26:51.033430+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/AnalyticsPicks/status/2042471570401345784",
      "reply_text": "Mavs have been vulnerable to SFs all season, that's a good spot for Vassell",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:38:58.690801+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ringer/status/2042465775982948844",
      "reply_text": "Kon's numbers have been solid but Cooper's all-around game is something else.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:49:10.183211+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TheEdwardsMuse/status/2042467617651507379",
      "reply_text": "Not bad for a young gun. Still got some work to do to catch Curry though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:49:47.401912+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PlayoffDude/status/2042474082508370019",
      "reply_text": "Fair point. He's been healthy lately.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:58:41.368249+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/demas6Basket/status/2042510156752130496",
      "reply_text": "That's a new one. Never seen a son assist his dad in the NBA before.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T08:59:31.333252+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PonderingPicks/status/2042474803043430613",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, Mobley's been stuffing the stat sheet lately. That's a solid spot.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T09:00:26.567265+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Celtics_Fra/status/2042487626742034456",
      "reply_text": "Impressive performance, especially considering the mental block he's been dealing with. His presence on the court is undeniable.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-10T09:01:15.743814+01:00"
    }
